    "snippet": "Although we are still four days out, confidence is quite good in shower activity blossoming at some point Thursday night/Friday morning across south-central Arizona and lasting through much of Friday. Guidance also shows modest MUCAPE of 250-500 J/kg on Friday which should allow for some isolated to scattered weak thunderstorms.",
